{"id": "22-5714-2-4", "zh": "nta、māna 词缀章", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5715-2-7", "zh": "下面讲 nta、māna 这两个词缀。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5716-2-21", "zh": "772. 现在时表施事时用 nto［ka.565；rū.646；nī.1157］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5717-2-13", "zh": "vattamāna 指现在（paccuppanna）：在现在时，动词词根之后表施事时，加 nto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5718-2-23", "zh": "bhū 表示“存在”。依“kattari lo”规则加 a 词缀，依“yuvaṇṇānameopaccaye”规则作 o 增音。bhavati（存在）就成为 bhonto：bhonto-puriso（存在着的男子）、bhontaṃ-kulaṃ（存在着的家族）、bhontī-itthī（存在着的女子）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5719-2-22", "zh": "又依“eonamayavā sare”规则，o 替换为 av：bhavaṃ-puriso、bhavantaṃ-kulaṃ，女性作 bhavantī、bhavatī 或 bhotī-itthī。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5720-2-19", "zh": "773. māno［ka.565；rū.646；nī.1157］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5721-2-9", "zh": "在现在时，动词词根之后表施事时，加 māno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5722-2-7", "zh": "bhavamāno-puriso、bhavamānaṃ-kulaṃ、bhavamānā-itthī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5723-2-20", "zh": "774. 表行为与受事时也用［ka.565；rū.646；nī.1157］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5724-2-12", "zh": "在现在时，动词词根之后表行为（bhāva）与受事（kamma）时，也加 māno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5724-13-20", "zh": "依“kyo bhāvakammesu…”规则加 ya 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5725-2-12", "zh": "anubhūyati（被享受），就成为 anubhūyamāno：anubhūyamāno bhogo purisena（被男子享用的财物）、anubhūyamānā sampatti（被享受的荣华）、anubhūyamānaṃ sukhaṃ（被享受的安乐）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5726-2-6", "zh": "y 重叠时作 anubhuyyamāno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5727-2-7", "zh": "775. 未来时，这两个词缀前加 ssa。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-5728-2-11", "zh": "要表达未来时的时候，那两个 nta、māna 词缀前面加 ssa。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5729-2-25", "zh": "bhavissati（将存在），就成为 bhavissanto［形态规则参看 rū. 第 403 页］-puriso、bhavissantaṃ-kulaṃ、bhavissantī-vibhatti，或作 bhavissatī；以及 bhavissamāno、bhavissamānaṃ、bhavissamānā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-5730-2-3", "zh": "受事：anubhūyissamāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5731-2-7", "zh": "776. māna 的 m。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5732-2-7", "zh": "māna 词缀的 m 有时脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5733-2-30", "zh": "如 nisinno vā sayāno vā（或坐或卧）［khu.pā.9.9］、sato sampajāno（具念、正知）［dī.ni.1.217］；这里 n 一定脱落。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-5734-2-6", "zh": "paññāyanto、paññāyamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5735-2-3", "zh": "受事：viññāyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5736-2-7", "zh": "使役：ñāpento、ñāpayanto、ñāpayamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5737-2-3", "zh": "受事：ñāpīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5738-2-5", "zh": "kī 等词根类（kiyādigaṇa）：jānanto、jānamāno。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5739-2-5", "zh": "使役：jānāpento、jānāpayamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5740-2-3", "zh": "受事：jānāpīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5741-2-13", "zh": "tiṭṭhaṃ、tiṭṭhanto、tiṭṭhamāno、saṇṭhahaṃ、saṇṭhahanto、saṇṭhahamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5742-2-3", "zh": "受事：upaṭṭhīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5743-2-7", "zh": "使役：patiṭṭhāpento、patiṭṭhāpayanto、patiṭṭhāpayamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5744-2-3", "zh": "受事：patiṭṭhāpīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5745-2-15", "zh": "dento、dadanto、dajjanto、samādiyanto、dadamāno、dajjamāno、samādīyamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5746-2-5", "zh": "受事：dīyamāno、diyyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5747-2-9", "zh": "使役：dāpento、dāpayanto、samādapayanto（此处变为短音）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-5748-2-5", "zh": "受事：dāpīyamāno、samādāpīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5749-2-19", "zh": "nidhento、nidahanto、nidahamāno、nidhiyyamāno、nidhāpento、nidhāpayanto、nidhāpayamāno、nidhāpīyamāno、yāyanto。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5749-20-48", "zh": "如 yāyantam anuyāyanti（他们跟随前行的人）［jā.2.22.1753］；yāyamāno mahārājā, addā sīdantare nage（大王前行的时候，看见了悉达海之间的群山）［jā.2.22.566］。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5749-49-101", "zh": "vāyanto、vāyamāno、nibbāyanto、parinibbāyanto、nibbāyamāno、nibbāpento、nibbāpayamāno、nibbāpīyamāno、osāyanto、osāpento、osāpayanto、pahāyanto、pahāyamāno、jahanto、jahamāno、pahīyamāno、pahiyyamāno、jahīyamāno、hāpento、hāpayanto、hāpayamāno、jahāpento、jahāpayanto、jahāpayamāno、hāpīyamāno、jahāpīyamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5750-2-13", "zh": "以 i、ī 结尾的词根：vikkayanto、vikkiṇanto、vinicchayanto、vinicchinanto——在 ni 之后，c 变为 ch。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-5751-2-44", "zh": "ācayanto、ācinanto、jayanto、jinanto、ḍento、ḍemāno、nento、vinento、nayanto、vinayanto、nayamāno、niyyamāno、nayāpento、nayāpayamāno、sento、sayanto、semāno、sayamāno，或作 sayāno；pahiṇanto、pahiṇamāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5752-2-46", "zh": "以 u、ū 结尾的词根：cavanto、cavamāno、ṭhānā cāvanto（使从位置上坠落）、cāvayanto、cāvayamāno、javanto、javamāno、abhitthavanto、abhitthavamāno、abhitthavīyamāno、sandhavanto、sandhavamāno、dhunanto、niddhunanto、dhunamāno、niddhunamāno、punanto、ravanto、lunanto、āvuṇanto、pasavanto、vissavanto。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5753-2-3", "zh": "受事：suyyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5754-2-5", "zh": "使役：sāvento、sāvayanto。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5755-2-5", "zh": "su 等词根类（svādigaṇa）：suṇanto、suṇamāno。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5756-2-5", "zh": "使役：suṇāpento、suṇāpayanto。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5757-2-5", "zh": "hu 表示“供奉”：juhonto。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5758-2-8", "zh": "带 pa 前缀时表示“足够、能够”：pahonto、sampahonto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5759-2-5", "zh": "hū 表示“存在”：honto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5760-2-4", "zh": "以 e 结尾的词根：ento。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5760-5-55", "zh": "如 atthaṃ entamhi sūriye（太阳西沉的时候）［jā.2.22.2187（作 atthaṅgatamhi）］；samento、abhisamento、khāyanto、khāyamāno、gāyanto、gāyamāno、gāyīyamāno、gāyāpento、gāyāpayanto、apacāyanto、dhammaṃ apacāyamāno（恭敬法）、jhāyanto、jhāyamāno、pajjhāyanto、ujjhāyanto、nijjhāyanto、abhijjhāyanto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5761-2-7", "zh": "使役：jhāpento、ujjhāpento——y 脱落。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5762-2-15", "zh": "bhāyanto、bhāyamāno、sāliṃ lāyanto（割稻）、lāyamāno、cīvaraṃ vāyanto（织衣）、vāyamāno。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5763-2-14", "zh": "kile 表示“嬉戏”与“爱惜”：kelāyanto、kelāyamāno，意思是摆弄或者爱惜。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "22-5764-2-5", "zh": "gile 表示“生病”：gilāyanto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5765-2-5", "zh": "cine 表示“轻视”：cināyanto。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5766-2-5", "zh": "pale 表示“行走”：palāyanto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5767-2-5", "zh": "mile 表示“衰损”：milāyanto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-5768-2-6", "zh": "saṅkase 表示“居住”：saṅkasāyanto，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5769-2-36", "zh": "多辅音词根：asa 表示“存在”，依“ntamānāntantiyiyuṃsvādilopo”规则，在 nta、māna 之前词首脱落：santo、samāno；upāsanto、upāsamāno、upāsīyamāno、icchanto、icchamāno、icchīyamāno、gacchanto、gacchamāno、gacchīyamāno。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-5770-2-45", "zh": "y 同化为前一字母时：gammamāno、adhigammamāno。未来时前加 ssa：依“labha vasa chida gama bhida rudānaṃ cchaṅa”规则，词根末音连同 ssa 变为 cch，得 gacchanto；又有 gamissanto、gacchamāno、gamissamāno；jiranto、jiramāno、jiyyanto、jiyyamāno、dahanto、dahamāno。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-5771-2-10", "zh": "dah 的 d 变为 ḍ：ḍahanto、ḍahamāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5772-2-3", "zh": "受事：ḍayhamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5773-2-9", "zh": "disa 表示“观看”：passanto、passamāno、passīyamāno。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-5774-2-7", "zh": "使役：dassento、dassayanto、dassayamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5775-2-5", "zh": "labhanto、labhamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5776-2-8", "zh": "受事时同化为前一字母：labbhamāno、upalabbhamāno。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-5777-2-9", "zh": "未来时：lacchanto、labhissanto、lacchamāno、labhissamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5778-2-9", "zh": "maranto、maramāno、miyanto、miyamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5779-2-11", "zh": "yamu 表示“止息”：niyamanto、saññamanto、saññamamāno、niyacchanto。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-5780-2-3", "zh": "使役：niyāmento。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5781-2-7", "zh": "rudanto、rodanto、rodamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5782-2-9", "zh": "未来时：rucchanto、rodissanto、rucchamāno、rodissamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5783-2-5", "zh": "vacanto、vacamāno。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-5784-2-10", "zh": "受事时依“assū”规则变为 u：vuccamāno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5785-2-7", "zh": "使役：vācento、vācayanto、vācayamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5786-2-3", "zh": "受事：vācīyamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5787-2-31", "zh": "未来时：依“vaca bhuja muca visānaṃ kkhaṅa”规则，词根末音连同 ssa 替换为 kkh：vakkhanto、vakkhamāno；又有 vadanto、vadamāno、ovadanto、ovadamāno、vajjanto、vajjamāno。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-5788-2-7", "zh": "受事：vadīyamāno、ovadīyamāno、ovajjamāno。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-5789-2-6", "zh": "使役：bheriṃ vādento（击鼓）、vādayamāno。", "confidence": 82}
